cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: 'EUDI Disclosure Policy: verifier-side preflight for OpenID4VP DCQL requests'
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript library and CLI that checks every credential and claim
  alternative of an OpenID4VP 1.0 DCQL request against a local
  data-minimization policy before the request reaches a European Digital
  Identity Wallet.
type: software
authors:
  - name: su.engineering
    website: https://su.engineering
repository-code: https://github.com/su-engineering/eudi-disclosure-policy
url: https://su.engineering/open-source
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - EUDI Wallet
  - OpenID4VP
  - DCQL
  - data minimization
  - SD-JWT VC
  - ISO mdoc
  - eIDAS 2.0
  - verifiable credentials
  - policy as code
